        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Fetty Wap, Natalie La Rose, Zaytoven, T-Wayne\n- Songs: \"Trap Queen\", \"Around the World\", \"Nasty Freestyle\"\n- Organizations: RGF Productions\n\nFacts:\n- Fetty Wap co-wrote \"Around the World\" by Natalie La Rose.\n- Fetty Wap worked with producer Zaytoven.\n- Fetty Wap's debut single is \"Trap Queen\".\n- T-Wayne performs \"Nasty Freestyle\".\n- Fetty Wap belongs to RGF Productions, the same label associated with \"Nasty Freestyle\".",
